{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ויפץ</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, ויפץ העם בכל ארץ מצרים, and ויפץ העם מעליו in the section of Saul. And this is what the Sages said: The men of the Tower and the men of Egypt were fit for one punishment — these were scattered from the Tower and those from Egypt. And this is: ויפץ העם מעליו." "<b>ויחדלו</b> Twice in the Masorah: here and ויחדלו הקולות והברד. Teaches that these too were judged with sounds and hail."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:57.157556894Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}